# Keys and labels that need quoting, and the escapes that avoid it.
"dotted.key": a key with a dot in it
'single quoted': and one in single quotes
spaced key: spaces need no quotes at all
escaped\.key: an escaped dot
hyphen-key: a hyphen is a name character
"key with: colon": colons too
plus: "a label with \"quotes\" in it"
unicode: ääkköset ja 日本語
"dotted.key" -> spaced key: label with -> in it
